ernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for all S_out positions and all D dimensions.\n        # The kernel will compute the output for one (b, hq) pair.\n        # The kernel will c